4-602.13 The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
1. bottom inside the grill cooler (food debris and plastic liner intended to be removed once installed);
2. bottom inside southwest cooler (food debris);
3. bottom inside the upright freezer (food crumbs);
4. lower compartment behind foot peddle at handwashing sink by chicken walkin cooler (general buildup);
5. main walkin cooler shelving (mold/general buildup);  and
6. condenser fan covers in both walkin coolers (general buildup/dust).
Nonfood contact surfaces shall be cleaned at a frequency necessary to eliminate buildup of grease, food splash and general debris.
